Package: hpc-kbd
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: HPC <hpc@local>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0
Description: On-screen keyboard for Droidian/Phosh (uinput backend)
 Dep-free on-screen keyboard: emits keys through a Linux uinput
 virtual keyboard (no pywayland/cffi), so it installs with dpkg -i
 even when the Debian repositories are unreachable. EN (QWERTY),
 FA (Persian) and symbol layouts. Needs root for /dev/uinput
 (sudo -E hpc-kbd, or tap "Run as root" in the app; a polkit rule
 allows passwordless exec of hpc-kbd).
